OL,3,GNEWSABaby cinema clubs to show 18
OL,4,Acertificate films
OL,5,
OL,6,FParent and baby cinema clubs in York
OL,7,Fwill be allowed to show films with a 15
OL,8,Fand 18 age certificate following a
OL,9,Fdecision by the council.
OL,11,FMothers told a City of York Council
OL,12,Fmeeting the screenings were one of the
OL,13,Ffew activities catering to them as well
OL,14,Fas their babies, but said the choice of
OL,15,Ffilms was currently limited.
OL,17,FThe change follows similar initiatives
OL,18,Fin Leeds and Chelmsford, and will allow
OL,19,Fcontrolled entry of infants to
OL,20,Fage-specific films, but not the general
OL,21,Fadmission of children.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
