OL,3,GNEWSABaby cinema clubs to show 18
OL,4,Acertificate films
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite some councillors expressing
OL,7,Fconcern about the material to which
OL,8,Fbabies could be exposed, York Council's
OL,9,FLicensing and Regulatory Committee
OL,10,Fapproved the move at a meeting on
OL,11,FTuesday.
